<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka's Hayleys in bonus issue.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka's Hayleys in bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombo blue chip Hayleys Ltd said it was making a bonus issue of one new share for every 11 held, a stock exchange release said on Monday.</p>
<p>The company's issued capital will rise accordingly to 24 million shares, from the current 22 million.</p>
<p>Hayleys is one of three conglomerates lised in Colombo. The company consolidates accounts with 65 units, eight of which are listed.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
